<h2>One place for every lease.<br>One workflow for every issue.</h2>
<p class="lead">The PropertyList Rentals module covers the full rental lifecycle -- from tenancy ledger and automated renewal reminders, through maintenance triage, to landlord portfolio tracking and deposit dispute evidence.</p>
